' SAFETY: AI-assisted golden example. The author reviews, validates and simulates the job,
' then a human approves the gated push (HITL). Authors a MOTION job-list only; collision
' zones, safety planes and E-stop stay on the TMflow robot controller, never in this job.
'
' NEGATIVE example added to the safety-linter golden corpus (doc 69 C4): FARSIDE's x
' coordinate is far outside a conservative workspace envelope. Structurally unsafe (a huge
' reach target) even though nothing here names any safety concept at all -- the linter flags
' it on the numeric literal, not on vocabulary.
'
' Techman TMflow job-list: reach a far pallet position, then return to a normal drop point.
POINT FARSIDE = (3200, -150, 200, 3.142, 0, 0)
POINT DROPOFF = (450, 150, 200, 3.142, 0, 0)

HOME
MOVE FARSIDE
GRIP
WAIT t=300
MOVEL DROPOFF
RELEASE
WAIT t=300
HOME
